1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,552
My favorite fruit is watermelon
我最喜欢的水果是西瓜

2
00:00:01,552 --> 00:00:02,153
In the summer
在夏天

3
00:00:02,153 --> 00:00:03,986
my mom buys a big watermelon
我妈妈买了一个大西瓜

4
00:00:04,192 --> 00:00:06,426
We cut the watermelon into small pieces
我们把西瓜切成小块

5
00:00:06,593 --> 00:00:08,586
The color of the watermelon is red
西瓜的颜色是红色的

6
00:00:08,753 --> 00:00:10,865
and it has many black seeds inside
而且里面有很多黑色的种子

7
00:00:11,153 --> 00:00:12,471
I Like to eat watermelon
我喜欢吃西瓜

8
00:00:12,473 --> 00:00:15,305
because it is very sweet and juicy
因为它非常甜和多汁

9
00:00:15,429 --> 00:00:16,106
Sometimes
有时

10
00:00:16,106 --> 00:00:20,265
I eat watermelon with my friends and we see who can eat the fastest
我和我的朋友一起吃西瓜看谁吃得最快

11
00:00:20,593 --> 00:00:22,801
Eating watermelon is a happy thing!
吃西瓜是一件快乐的事！

